+        Inverse of the parameter replacement done by process_weights_after_loading:
+        deletes the kernel-format parameters and re-runs create_weights with the
+        stashed construction arguments. Called by initialize_layerwise_reload.
+        """
+        for name in (
+            "w13_weight",
+            "w2_weight",
+            "w13_weight_scale",
